A '''Super Scrubber''' is a {{Rare}} Item that removes [[Pet Items]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Super Scrubber''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Plumber Joe}} for {{c|25k}}.

== Usage ==
Right-clicking a [[Pet]] whilst holding a '''Super Scrubber''' will open a menu to confirm removing the pet item. Removing a pet item costs a varying amount of {{c}} depending on the rarity of the pet item, and consumes the '''Super Scrubber'''.

